  (text "J3: LOCAL DEBUG BUS (GND / +3V3 / SDA / SCL); onboard supply.\nJ9: dedicated standard Qwiic master port. J1 / J12 / J17: powered sensors.\nMultiple boards: external TCA9548A at 0x71; one channel active.\nDisable PCA9685 ALLCALL after initialization."
    (at 640.08 254 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "037bbb2f-fba8-4efd-972c-b436bbf0745a")
  )
  (text "LOCAL A: RheoBoard +3V3 and sensor bus\nHOST B: ESP32-supplied +3V3; regulators never paralleled\n100 kHz initial bring-up; cable/module pull-ups share a current budget\nJ1 / J12 / J17 remain powered Qwiic sensor ports\nJ3 = LOCAL DEBUG BUS; no master-power isolation at that header"
    (at 643.89 340.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "436423bd-8c01-4d0e-a201-868018e3417c")
  )
